      "text": "这个手机比那个手机便宜多了。",
      "file": "c07-s14.mp3",
      "sha256": "bb4c58e2fb6e55ddb812d2a38ee75b81a90bc4b08bf0fc6d5b1ab0b049c3fc4f"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s11",
      "text": "A比B高五厘米。",
      "file": "c07-s11.mp3",
      "sha256": "68d82212094384b050f83d9c99e9125ec91c695366ddd43c46f02838be3828bb"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s16",
      "text": "这个手机比那个手机贵吗？",
      "file": "c07-s16.mp3",
      "sha256": "777967d2cc2f48a8d93d9004e3ce53e0e92993a325cf53126454eab2ab3f9370"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s15",
      "text": "这个手机比那个手机便宜一点儿。",
      "file": "c07-s15.mp3",
      "sha256": "962a9e75d9d72aa5aa2dd2b3dc9af047f74c0d5ac87de57766877abe569e1ed6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s18",
      "text": "医生比护士重要多了！",
      "file": "c07-s18.mp3",
      "sha256": "a5f769d6e8f13ea83951aacdb8f2fcb08bd79c178b3130a29e8311f8381a73cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s19",
      "text": "大夫比护士重要多了！",
      "file": "c07-s19.mp3",
      "sha256": "5a723e671970e611ef6a3813de827f6680ca6405410137ed13bd797f9eaf20e1"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s21",
      "text": "我们去桂花公园吧。",
      "file": "c07-s21.mp3",
      "sha256": "0f833269ff4c897db83bc25814d186d5b4ff609e08cf4e673c93108733c423ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s20",
      "text": "这个公园很大。",
      "file": "c07-s20.mp3",
      "sha256": "8450f67b2011ee9828359e1c089dfe26b17d5d9ffe863d730f6adc04c2db333b"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s17",
      "text": "英语比汉语难多了。",
      "file": "c07-s17.mp3",
      "sha256": "14d04ae7a6e458eeee9f08d117238d94d429916085f9c30618ded83948a7e35d"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s22",
      "text": "公园里有一个池塘。",
      "file": "c07-s22.mp3",
      "sha256": "3a1cdb248d6636b4e54aaa4d71ac0352077db643812ee83102b3782fa1e572d8"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s24",
      "text": "食堂的食物很便宜。",
      "file": "c07-s24.mp3",
      "sha256": "b4afe64d3a05161c5aac48be285dffece9ecc1a8c62721b2edba292f4a740bfc"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s23",
      "text": "我在食堂吃饭。",
      "file": "c07-s23.mp3",
      "sha256": "fe319d6a48df09664e50fb59bcc669f55349b782f56e3699aab3db3db02fcab2"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s27",
      "text": "不要糖。",
      "file": "c07-s27.mp3",
      "sha256": "aec1141aed30b248132812dd3b20effcb656ee3f54053b0f4b6c59ff5775972e"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s26",
      "text": "他是单身。",
      "file": "c07-s26.mp3",
      "sha256": "a689b64682364c2e9d5a67615d43313f4ca13398fe41885d520c5ad9ab42f998"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s25",
      "text": "我每星期六上午去公园。",
      "file": "c07-s25.mp3",
      "sha256": "8e692d202a4dd7a48708d835c990f2cde0f7ee417a707fbdf2d65a258f7d9c3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s30",
      "text": "你要可口可乐还是百事可乐？",
      "file": "c07-s30.mp3",
      "sha256": "0f929a6a9a2591f5382d293dd1459f1412b794cd3e6fdab7087f4badf109c9e9"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s28",
      "text": "不要冰。",
      "file": "c07-s28.mp3",
      "sha256": "969fcea09ee37d0608d888175b0742c0c61c6a1c57dc9f3cc825bff181a71bef"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s29",
      "text": "我要无糖可乐，不要冰。",
      "file": "c07-s29.mp3",
      "sha256": "70ed0b9aa97874aa3d0c03f273d5970585188f8cfab3ecf01cfdb49774031d83"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s31",
      "text": "我要百事可乐。",
      "file": "c07-s31.mp3",
      "sha256": "3e6b33cacbd608959f5e0fee1ee6d86ad3b1926744261779d021f4dc925ec163"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s33",
      "text": "他是电气工程师。",
      "file": "c07-s33.mp3",
      "sha256": "a04c7a0db40a946851e9e518767662b5226919855c9bd3a98f86adc8bafdeba1"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s32",
      "text": "我学电气工程。",
      "file": "c07-s32.mp3",
      "sha256": "9c8de6b318f1e0106cafa6bb143a361e53536621216306f2a395d34f623601f9"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s36",
      "text": "我想买这个手机。",
      "file": "c07-s36.mp3",
      "sha256": "04511b9e36c8a596315cef9edc997ab8677970dfc528066726e42bef10842e02"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s35",
      "text": "这个手机一千八百元，那个手机一万元。",
      "file": "c07-s35.mp3",
      "sha256": "9fd9f5634d0781e7ac53e514d9c47cc13201a42ec88770d8df75e4a75a41a81c"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s37",
      "text": "我每星期六上午去桂花公园。",
      "file": "c07-s37.mp3",
      "sha256": "ae313f103f94b406e61dda9cf75c324315ba4a7ea6b281da771305fa0ad6f435"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s34",
      "text": "他是天才。",
      "file": "c07-s34.mp3",
      "sha256": "796d839f679df7612a9dac2b88af986cb671df088b15bf00376f67be2c4ea644"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s38",
      "text": "中午，我去食堂吃饭。",
      "file": "c07-s38.mp3",
      "sha256": "e232f592f95671a1d74f9e58c1865a6cb23cdc4ada4a7efca4a8a2c5c073e4fe"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s39",
      "text": "我的朋友是电工。",
      "file": "c07-s39.mp3",
      "sha256": "00a0a8a0e4b66294e1ce9414edc841292535fe33fd17482f73f27b4a2d5e2211"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s42",
      "text": "他是大夫。",
      "file": "c07-s42.mp3",
      "sha256": "b2400daff5da3e6b91a3fe1ce9adc0fdb0b6c21d5e975290bf2f7ca24de4bff1"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s40",
      "text": "我们去买可乐。",
      "file": "c07-s40.mp3",
      "sha256": "8801ab1c1ba20115c35577457f7fb516dc82b98daf170b38c9b0de194f3b154c"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s41",
      "text": "她是医生。",
      "file": "c07-s41.mp3",
      "sha256": "c340e8fdc7b9253ea4e61005131561bb50ff4d9bbc2a77a69e0782391dca17d2"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s44",
      "text": "健康很重要。",
      "file": "c07-s44.mp3",
      "sha256": "f4cf5e3f080332402308d92f5ed135d428987542736319d4900610fba17e64cb"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s45",
      "text": "我学英语。",
      "file": "c07-s45.mp3",
      "sha256": "266bdd35e4d9fa54b521f854b60977e5995a3bd26dc7fd56a5b10c2aeef679db"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s46",
      "text": "我学汉语。",
      "file": "c07-s46.mp3",
      "sha256": "7614afbfb45700a589cc7843189c9e68a21cec06a912660fe4e50b8070af7f65"
    },
    {
      "id": "c07-s48",
      "text": "这个包比那个包轻。",
      "file": "c07-s48.mp3",
      "sha256": "673db67a79adfbb3be811bbc6727897d9db77dd350cfac1686403dc42c7c6b82"
    },
